# Placeholder Makefile: techpack/data carries no kbuild objects on this
# tree (the rmnet SHS/perf config sources under drivers/rmnet/ are not
# wired into any build here). techpack/Kbuild auto-discovers every
# subdirectory of techpack/, and both scripts/Makefile.build and
# scripts/Makefile.modbuiltin require a Makefile (or Kbuild) to exist in
# each discovered directory. Without this file the build dies early with:
#   make: *** No rule to make target '../techpack/data/Makefile'. Stop.
